#: src/Admin/CoversPage.php:86
msgid ""
"Looks for the cover of releases without photo in the Cover Art Archive, the "
"open cover database of MusicBrainz and the Internet Archive. The pressing is"
" identified by its Discogs ID, then its barcode, then its artist and catalog"
" number."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/CoversPage.php:87
msgid ""
"These covers are shown with the mention \"Illustration\", since your copy "
"may differ. Your own photos always take priority: importing a photo replaces"
" the illustration."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/CoversPage.php:89
msgid ""
"External service: for each release, its Discogs ID, barcode, catalog number "
"and artist are sent to musicbrainz.org, and the cover is downloaded from "
"coverartarchive.org (Internet Archive). Covers remain the property of their "
"rights holders; the archive provides them without any licence. Displaying "
"them is your decision."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/CoversPage.php:94
msgid ""
"When the exact pressing has no cover, use the cover of another edition of "
"the same album"
msgstr ""

